{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "dana-api-complete-collection-v2",
		"name": "DANA API - Complete Collection v2",
		"description": "Koleksi API lengkap untuk DANA Payment Integration (BAZNAS Cinta Zakat)\n\nBase URL:\n- Production: https://be-dana.vercel.app\n- Local: http://127.0.0.1:5000\n\nAuthentication:\n- Bearer Token (JWT) untuk endpoint yang dilindungi\n- Header: Authorization: Bearer {{jwt_token}}\n\nSemua endpoint termasuk: Auth, DANA Payment, SNAP API, User, Campaign, Content, Disburse",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "🟢 Health & Status",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Root Health Check",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": [""]
						},
						"description": "Health check root dengan DB connection test\n\nResponse:\n```json\n{\n  \"status_code\": 200,\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"service\": \"be-dana\",\n    \"status\": \"running\",\n    \"database\": \"connected\"\n  }\n}\n```"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "API Health (no DB)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/health",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "health"]
						},
						"description": "Simple health check tanpa DB call (lebih cepat)\n\nResponse:\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"service\": \"be-dana\",\n  \"database_url_set\": true\n}\n```"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Auth Service Health",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/health",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "health"]
						},
						"description": "Health check untuk Auth service"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "🔐 Auth",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Seamless Login",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
									"        pm.environment.set('jwt_token', json.data.token);",
									"        console.log('JWT token saved:', json.data.token.substring(0, 20) + '...');",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"external_id\": \"USER-123456\",\n  \"access_token\": \"optional_dana_access_token\",\n  \"user_info\": {\n    \"name\": \"Ahmad Muzaki\",\n    \"phone\": \"08123456789\",\n    \"email\": \"ahmad@example.com\"\n  }\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/seamless-login",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "seamless-login"]
						},
						"description": "Login seamless setelah mendapatkan token dari DANA Mini App\n\nFlow Mini Program:\n1. FE: my.getAuthCode() → dapat auth_code\n2. FE: POST /apply-token dengan auth_code → dapat access_token DANA\n3. FE: POST /seamless-login dengan external_id + access_token → dapat JWT kita\n\nResponse:\n```json\n{\n  \"status_code\": 200,\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"token\": \"eyJ...\",\n    \"user\": { \"id\": 1, \"email\": \"...\", \"nama\": \"...\" },\n    \"muzaki\": { \"id\": 5, \"npwz\": \"997720010000389\" }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n⚠️ JWT token otomatis tersimpan ke environment variable `jwt_token`"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Generate OAuth URL",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"external_id\": \"USER-{{$timestamp}}\",\n  \"redirect_url\": \"{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/finish-redirect\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/generate-oauth-url",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "generate-oauth-url"]
						},
						"description": "Generate DANA OAuth URL untuk binding akun (non-Mini Program)\n\nNote: Untuk Mini Program, gunakan my.getAuthCode() langsung"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Apply Token (Exchange Auth Code)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json.data && json.data.accessToken) {",
									"        pm.environment.set('dana_access_token', json.data.accessToken);",
									"        console.log('DANA access token saved');",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"auth_code\": \"auth_code_dari_dana_mini_app\",\n  \"external_id\": \"USER-123456\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/apply-token",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "apply-token"]
						},
						"description": "Tukar auth code dari DANA Mini App dengan access token DANA\n\nResponse:\n```json\n{\n  \"status_code\": 200,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"accessToken\": \"...\",\n    \"refreshToken\": \"...\",\n    \"expiresIn\": 3600\n  }\n}\n```"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Refresh Token",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
									"        pm.environment.set('jwt_token', json.data.token);",
									"        console.log('JWT token refreshed and saved');",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"token\": \"{{jwt_token}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/refresh-token",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "refresh-token"]
						},
						"description": "Refresh expired JWT token\n\nResponse:\n```json\n{\n  \"status_code\": 200,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"token\": \"eyJ...\"\n  }\n}\n```"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "DANA Unbind (Logout)",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{jwt_token}}", "type": "string"}]
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/dana-unbind",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "dana-unbind"]
						},
						"description": "Unbind/Logout akun DANA\n\nRequires: Bearer token\n\nResponse:\n```json\n{\n  \"status_code\": 200,\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"message\": \"DANA account unbound successfully\"\n}\n```"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Finish Redirect (OAuth Callback)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/auth/finish-redirect?authCode=AUTH_CODE_DARI_DANA&externalId=USER-123456",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "finish-redirect"],
							"query": [
								{"key": "authCode", "value": "AUTH_CODE_DARI_DANA"},
								{"key": "externalId", "value": "USER-123456"}
							]
						},
						"description": "Callback setelah OAuth redirect dari DANA\n\nSupports GET & POST\n\nResponse:\n```json\n{\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"authCode\": \"...\",\n    \"externalId\": \"...\"\n  }\n}\n```"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "💳 DANA Payment",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Create Order",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json.status === 'success' && json.data) {",
									"        pm.environment.set('order_id', json.data.orderId);",
									"        pm.environment.set('trade_no', json.data.tradeNO || json.data.danaReferenceNo || '');",
									"        console.log('order_id saved:', json.data.orderId);",
									"        console.log('trade_no saved:', json.data.tradeNO || json.data.danaReferenceNo);",
									"    }",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{jwt_token}}",
								"description": "Optional - jika sudah login",
								"disabled": true
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"nominal\": 10000,\n  \"email\": \"donor@example.com\",\n  \"nama_lengkap\": \"Ahmad Donor\",\n  \"campaign_id\": 1,\n  \"tipe_zakat\": \"Zakat Mal\",\n  \"doa_muzaki\": \"Semoga berkah\",\n  \"hamba_allah\": false\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dana/create-order",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "dana", "create-order"]
						},
						"description": "Buat order pembayaran untuk DANA Mini Program\n\nField wajib: nominal, email, nama_lengkap, campaign_id\n\nResponse:\n```json\n{\n  \"status_code\": 200,\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"orderId\": \"DANA-20260227085323-9E7B2719\",\n    \"checkoutUrl\": \"https://...\",\n    \"danaReferenceNo\": \"20260227...\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n⚠️ orderId & tradeNO otomatis tersimpan ke environment variable"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Check Status (POST)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"order_id\": \"{{order_id}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dana/status",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "dana", "status"]
						},
						"description": "Cek status transaksi via POST\n\nResponse:\n```json\n{\n  \"status_code\": 200,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"orderId\": \"DANA-...\",\n    \"status\": \"berhasil\",\n    \"amount\": 10000,\n    \"lastUpdateTime\": \"2026-02-27T15:53:32+07:00\"\n  }\n}\n```"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Transaction History (GET)",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{jwt_token}}", "type": "string"}]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dana/history?month=2&year=2026&status=berhasil&limit=20&offset=0",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "dana", "history"],
							"query": [
								{"key": "month", "value": "2", "description": "Bulan (1-12)"},
								{"key": "year", "value": "2026"},
								{"key": "status", "value": "berhasil", "description": "belum / berhasil / gagal"},
								{"key": "limit", "value": "20"},
								{"key": "offset", "value": "0"}
							]
						},
						"description": "Riwayat transaksi dengan filter\n\nRequires: Bearer token\n\nQuery params:\n- month: 1-12\n- year: 4 digit\n- status: belum / berhasil / gagal\n- limit: max records (default 20)\n- offset: pagination offset"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Transaction History Paged",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{jwt_token}}", "type": "string"}]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dana/history/paged?page=1&pageSize=10",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "dana", "history", "paged"],
							"query": [
								{"key": "page", "value": "1"},
								{"key": "pageSize", "value": "10"}
							]
						},
						"description": "Riwayat transaksi dengan pagination\n\nRequires: Bearer token\n\nResponse:\n```json\n{\n  \"status_code\": 200,\n  \"data\": [...],\n  \"pagination\": {\n    \"page\": 1,\n    \"pageSize\": 10,\n    \"total\": 50\n  }\n}\n```"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Transaction Detail by RefNo",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{jwt_token}}", "type": "string"}]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dana/history/{{order_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "dana", "history", "{{order_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Detail transaksi berdasarkan reference number\n\nRequires: Bearer token"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Cancel Order",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"order_id\": \"{{order_id}}\",\n  \"reason\": \"User cancelled payment\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dana/cancel-order",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "dana", "cancel-order"]
						},
						"description": "Batalkan order yang belum dibayar\n\nHanya bisa dibatalkan jika status masih 'belum'"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Refund Order",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{jwt_token}}", "type": "string"}]
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"order_id\": \"{{order_id}}\",\n  \"reason\": \"Customer request refund\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dana/refund-order",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "dana", "refund-order"]
						},
						"description": "Refund order yang sudah selesai\n\nRequires: Bearer token\n\nHanya bisa direfund jika status sudah 'berhasil'"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Balance Inquiry",
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "bearer",
							"bearer": [{"key": "token", "value": "{{jwt_token}}", "type": "string"}]
						},
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dana/balance-inquiry",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "dana", "balance-inquiry"]
						},
						"description": "Cek saldo akun DANA\n\nRequires: Bearer token\n\nResponse:\n```json\n{\n  \"status_code\": 200,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"balance\": \"100000.00\"\n  }\n}\n```"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Apply OTT (Legacy)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"order_id\": \"{{order_id}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dana/apply-ott",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "dana", "apply-ott"]
						},
						"description": "Apply OTT token (legacy, tidak diperlukan untuk Mini Program)\n\n⚠️ Deprecated - Gunakan Mini Program flow"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Finish Payment (Callback)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"orderId\": \"{{order_id}}\",\n  \"resultCode\": \"9000\",\n  \"resultStatus\": \"SUCCESS\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dana/finish-payment",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "dana", "finish-payment"]
						},
						"description": "Callback setelah user selesai di halaman pembayaran DANA\n\nSupports GET & POST\n\nResult Codes:\n- 9000: Payment success\n- 4000: Payment failed\n- 6001: User cancelled\n- 6002: Network error\n- 8000: Processing"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Webhook (DANA Notification)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "X-SIGNATURE", "value": "{{dana_signature}}", "description": "Digital signature dari DANA"},
							{"key": "X-TIMESTAMP", "value": "2026-02-27T08:53:32+00:00", "description": "ISO 8601 timestamp"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"originalPartnerReferenceNo\": \"CINTA-20260227085323-C821FD\",\n  \"originalReferenceNo\": \"20260227111212800110166636602487835\",\n  \"merchantId\": \"{{merchant_id}}\",\n  \"amount\": {\n    \"value\": \"10000.00\",\n    \"currency\": \"IDR\"\n  },\n  \"latestTransactionStatus\": \"00\",\n  \"transactionStatusDesc\": \"SUCCESS\",\n  \"finishedTime\": \"2026-02-27T15:53:32+07:00\",\n  \"createdTime\": \"2026-02-27T15:53:24+07:00\",\n  \"additionalInfo\": {\n    \"paymentInfo\": {\n      \"paidTime\": \"2026-02-27T15:53:32+07:00\",\n      \"payOptionInfos\": [\n        {\n          \"payMethod\": \"BALANCE\",\n          \"payAmount\": {\"value\": \"10000.00\", \"currency\": \"IDR\"},\n          \"chargeAmount\": {\"value\": \"0.00\", \"currency\": \"IDR\"}\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dana/webhook",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "dana", "webhook"]
						},
						"description": "Webhook endpoint untuk notifikasi pembayaran dari DANA\n\nStatus Codes:\n- 00: SUCCESS\n- 01: FAILED\n- 02: PENDING\n\n⚠️ Endpoint ini dipanggil otomatis oleh DANA server saat status pembayaran berubah"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Simulate Webhook (Dev Only)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/dana/simulate-webhook/{{order_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "v1", "dana", "simulate-webhook", "{{order_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Simulasi webhook DANA untuk testing lokal\n\n⚠️ Hanya tersedia di mode development/local\n\nMensimulasikan payment SUCCESS untuk order_id yang diberikan"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "📡 SNAP API (ASPI Standard)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Debit Notify",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{"key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json"},
							{"key": "X-SIGNATURE", "value": "{{dana_signature}}"},
							{"key": "X-TIMESTAMP", "value": "2026-02-27T08:53:32+00:00"}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
